-- Drag Queen: on golden or fluffy pets the wig blended into the fur. Ask for a bold colour.
update public.personalities set image_prompt =
  'Dress the pet in a huge voluminous glittery wig in a bold colour clearly different from its fur (hot pink, electric purple or platinum silver), a sparkling sequin gown and a big feathered fan, keeping its natural face with no make-up. Place it centre stage under bright pink and purple spotlights on a glittering stage with a shiny curtain behind it.'
where id like '%-drag';
